<v Speaker 1>the first four verses Bismillah Rahman Raheem Alhamdulillahi Rabbil Alameen Ar Rahman Raheem Maliki Aumit Deen uh so now in this session we're going to look at Ihdina Saraatul Mustaqim this verse is commonly translated as guide us to the straight path right Ihdina Saraatul Mustaqim guide us to the straight path now

