<v Speaker 1>It is, you know, balancing, it is the balance between gaining the knowledge of Allah, right, striving to acquire the knowledge of his Tawhid, making a commitment, this promise, this Ahid, which has to come before the action, and only after that comes the instructions, right, the Hidayah.

349
00:42:25.810 --> 00:42:54.130
<v Speaker 1>and then we ask Allah to make us among those who created this balance between knowledge and action and this is why Maulana Ali says knowledge without action is a calamity on the soul and action without knowledge is pure ignorance it's perversion so success

350
00:42:54.370 --> 00:42:55.730
<v Speaker 1>It lies in the middle.

351
00:42:56.770 --> 00:43:01.770
<v Speaker 1>It lies at the center of this balance between knowledge and action.

352
00:43:04.050 --> 00:43:07.170
<v Speaker 1>That is the true manifestation of Abhudiya.

353
00:43:10.370 --> 00:43:22.050
<v Speaker 1>A slave who obeys through knowledge, who strives to understand the wisdom of his master's commands and then practically acts upon it realizing that this is for his own benefit.

354
